勞工未能分享成果 AI投資泡沫破裂，拖累股市與經濟成長。 華許說：「這些只是用來說明的情境，並非預測。」他解釋，Fed幕僚正運用簡化的經濟模型，測試未來幾年可能發生的情況。Fed正在為不同結果預作準備，而非預測哪一種情境最終會成真。 華許在談話中使用「超級智慧」(super intelligence，SI)一詞，呼應美國總統川普近期所下以「SI」取代AI的命令。他形容這是「經濟生活與社會中一股全新的力量」，且已開始改變經濟活動。","sentiment":-1,"tags":{"topics":["AI/半導體","總經/聯準會","關稅/地緣"],"bull":[],"bear":["不如預期"],"score":-3,"highlights":[],"keywords":["TOP","華許","Fed","聯準會","AI","SI","川普","人工智慧"]},"time":"11/17 07:50"}],"fund":{"code":"4111","rev_month":"11510","rev":114339.0,"rev_mom":-2.8662934425254645,"rev_yoy":2.2472412497987944,"rev_cum_yoy":5.222088362210589,"eps_q":2.35,"eps_year":"115","eps_season":"3","net_income":140552.0,"pe":8.92,"pb":1.15,"yield":4.68,"updated":"2026-11-27 02:23"},"tdcc":{"latest":{"date":"2026-11-20","big1000":30.56,"big400":44.0,"retail":16.35,"holders":46398},"prev":{"date":"2026-11-13","big1000":30.49,"big400":43.19,"retail":16.39,"holders":46376},"d_big1000":0.07,"d_big400":0.81,"d_retail":-0.04,"d_holders":22},"weekly":{"bars":[{"time":"2026-07-27","open":30.05,"high":30.15,"low":29.7,"close":29.85,"volume":266.912},{"time":"2026-08-03","open":29.8,"high":30.25,"low":29.45,"close":29.85,"volume":403.25600000000003},{"time":"2026-08-10","open":29.55,"high":30.1,"low":29.55,"close":29.85,"volume":534.678},{"time":"2026-08-17","open":29.85,"high":30.3,"low":29.7,"close":30.15,"volume":690.1030000000001},{"time":"2026-08-24","open":30.2,"high":30.3,"low":28.65,"close":28.75,"volume":688.315},{"time":"2026-08-31","open":28.75,"high":28.85,"low":28.6,"close":28.7,"volume":227.899},{"time":"2026-09-07","open":28.7,"high":28.95,"low":28.5,"close":28.8,"volume":134.625},{"time":"2026-09-14","open":28.8,"high":28.9,"low":28.4,"close":28.8,"volume":314.94},{"time":"2026-09-21","open":28.8,"high":28.9,"low":28.5,"close":28.7,"volume":159.166},{"time":"2026-09-29","open":28.7,"high":29.0,"low":28.55,"close":29.0,"volume":139.36},{"time":"2026-10-05","open":28.85,"high":29.1,"low":28.45,"close":29.0,"volume":206.313},{"time":"2026-10-12","open":29.0,"hig